╭─ Key bindings · project config ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ ▍  type to filter actions                                                Mode  all  conventional  vim      │
│                                                                                                            │
│ Global                                                                                                     ┃
│ ▌ Send the request (or start the gRPC call)                    Ctrl+Enter, F5, Ctrl+W e                    ┃
│   Cancel the running request or stream                         Ctrl+W x                                    ┃
│   Finish sending on a client/bidi stream (half-close)          Ctrl+W d                                    ┃
│   Re-send the active request on an interval (watch)            Ctrl+W m                                    ┃
