│   Pretty-print the JSON body / message                         Ctrl+W f                                    │
│   Edit the focused text in $VISUAL or $EDITOR                  Ctrl+W O                                    │
│   Move the plain value of the focused credential field into …  Ctrl+W K                                    │
│   Show or hide credentials typed as plain text (with Hide pl…  Ctrl+W *                                    │
